      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orleans_Township%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sixteen years later, the post office was renamed Orleans, honoring the New York county from which many settlers came.",
