        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orleans_Township%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Detroit, Lansing and Northern Railroad opened a depot in Orleans in 1870, linking the village to regional trade.",
